This repository contains two classes of content under two licenses:

1. VIEWER AND PIPELINE CODE (viewer/*.py, *.js, *.html, viewer/lib excluded
   where third-party notices apply): MIT License, below.

2. HARDWARE DESIGN ASSETS derived from the FAZE4 robotic arm by Petar Crnjak /
   Source Robotics (https://github.com/Source-Robotics/Faze4-Robotic-arm):
   all mesh files under viewer/assets derived from FAZE4 STLs, and the
   assembly-instruction page images under viewer/assets/pdfpages. These remain
   licensed under CERN-OHL-S-2.0 (CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 -
   Strongly Reciprocal), the license of the upstream project. Full text:
   https://ohwr.org/cern_ohl_s_v2.txt

   Modifications to those design files made in this repository (rebuild-parts
   meshes for MAD 8318/5010 motors, bored covers, relief-pocketed shafts, etc.)
   are likewise released under CERN-OHL-S-2.0.

three.js (viewer/lib) is MIT, Copyright (c) 2010-2024 three.js authors.

